{"id":"4146d431b2b74bbf","group":"27","path":"27/27-review-2026-10-16-r2.md","title":"2026-10-16 r2 历史复核计数的内部摘要","display":"2026-10-16 r2 历史复核计数的内部摘要","type":"index","metadata":{"type":"index","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-review-2026-10-16-r2","aliases":["27-review-2026-10-16-r2"],"display":"2026-10-16 r2 历史复核计数的内部摘要","depends_on":["[[27-MOC]]"],"verification_status":"reconstructed-internal-summary-from-supplied-files","local_review_date":"2026-10-20","historical_original_supplied":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"index"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-review-2026-10-16-r2"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-review-2026-10-16-r2</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"2026-10-16 r2 历史复核计数的内部摘要"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5244dbb38da17b8a\" href=\"?note=5244dbb38da17b8a\" title=\"27-MOC\">27-MOC</a></span></div>"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reconstructed-internal-summary-from-supplied-files"},{"key":"local_review_date","html":"2026-10-20"},{"key":"historical_original_supplied","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>数据逐项取自 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5244dbb38da17b8a\" href=\"?note=5244dbb38da17b8a\" title=\"27-MOC\">27-MOC</a>“本轮重新审查（2026-10-16 r2）”段落。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,m,u,b,s,p,q\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(a,m,u,b,s,p,q\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> 分别记录该段声称的审阅数学条目数、修订数、未改数、新增数、删除数、补来源字段数及其他修订数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"o\\in\\{0,1\\}\">\\(o\\in\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> 表示原始 r2 报告是否随附件提供，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span> 表示提供。这里记录历史文字声称的计数，不把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span> 等同于本次实际清点总数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\langle a,m,u,b,s,p,q,o\\rangle\\coloneqq\\langle449,41,408,0,0,18,23,0\\rangle.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\langle a,m,u,b,s,p,q,o\\rangle\\coloneqq\\langle449,41,408,0,0,18,23,0\\rangle.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a=m+u,\\qquad m=p+q,\\qquad b=s=0.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a=m+u,\\qquad m=p+q,\\qquad b=s=0.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原段落将其他修订概括为局部构造、绑定、定义域和来源范围说明，并说明 cyclic-function 保留为本地命名。现有相关入口是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c4267d89593cf1f4\" href=\"?note=c4267d89593cf1f4\" title=\"27-df-cyclicpi\">27-df-cyclicpi</a>。附件未提供41个文件的历史名单，因而本摘要不将本次改动倒填为 r2 的改动。</p>\n<p>原目录该段记录449条，而本次原始压缩包实际含450个数学条目；二者分别属于历史记录和当前清点，不混为同一次统计。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-MOC","status":"resolved","id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-MOC]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-MOC","status":"resolved","id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"数据逐项取自 [[27-MOC]]“本轮重新审查（2026-10-16 r2）”段落。$a,m,u,b,s,p,q\\in\\mathbb N$ 分别记录该段声称的审阅数学条目数、修订数、未改数、新增数、删除数、补来源字段数及其他修订数。$o\\in\\{0,1\\}$ 表示原始 r2 报告是否随附件提供，$1$ 表示提供。这里记录历史文字声称的计数，不把 $a$ 等同于本次实际清点总数。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-cyclicpi","status":"resolved","id":"c4267d89593cf1f4","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"原段落将其他修订概括为局部构造、绑定、定义域和来源范围说明，并说明 cyclic-function 保留为本地命名。现有相关入口是 [[27-df-cyclicpi]]。附件未提供41个文件的历史名单，因而本摘要不将本次改动倒填为 r2 的改动。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"a,m,u,b,s,p,q\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"o\\in\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"a","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle a,m,u,b,s,p,q,o\\rangle\\coloneqq\\langle449,41,408,0,0,18,23,0\\rangle.","display":true},{"tex":"a=m+u,\\qquad m=p+q,\\qquad b=s=0.","display":true}],"bytes":1482,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-604","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"全文复核449个既有数学原子；修订41个，复核未改408个，未新增或删除数学原子。18项补充可回查的来源字段，其余23项修订局部构造、绑定、定义域或来源域说明；未新增外部原子依赖。cyclic-function 是保留的本地命名，已与原书 essential 定义的来源资格区分。逐项证据、验证边界及仍保留的证明限制见 [[27-review-2026-10-16-r2]]。本节计数不包含历史报告、JSON及导航。"}],"outgoing":["5244dbb38da17b8a","c4267d89593cf1f4"]}